'''Sparkle10''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 500 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}} in the [[Sparkle Time Pack]] or by purchasing the whole pack. It is now only obtainable through trading, as the pack has since been removed from the shop.

== Appearance ==
It has a sparkly blade, hence the name, with many geometrical shapes varying in different shades of black. It has a silver guard and a solid black handle.

==Trivia==
*It is the last and most expensive knife out of the 10 knives in the [[Sparkle Time Pack]].
